    "block_position_policy": "Seeded edge placement: each seed chooses one tabletop edge and the matching public sweep direction; the block starts randomly along that edge within the blue-brush reachable workspace, away from the fixed near-hand tool start pose, so the 20-seed split covers reachable table-perimeter cases.",
